within eCherry_Library.Examples;
package PhotoVoltaics "models which use eCherry and the PhotoVoltaics by Brkic et al.
  
  CAUTION: THESE MODEL REQUIRE YOU TO LOAD THE PHOTOVOLTAICS LIBRARY
  IF YOU SEE CROSSED OUT BOXES -> PV LIBRARY NOT LOADED
  This library is implemented as a submodule within eCherry repo.
  For a detailed explanation consult the eCherry-Wiki.
  
  Git repo:  https://github.com/christiankral/PhotoVoltaics
  The paper: https://ep.liu.se/ecp/157/004/ecp19157004.pdf
  paper title: Open Source PhotoVoltaics Library for Systemic Investigations"
  extends Modelica.Icons.ExamplesPackage;

end PhotoVoltaics;
